From: postmarketOS Oculus Monterey maintainers <maintainers@postmarketos.org>
Subject: [PATCH] staging: oculus: ignore unavailable internal Kconfig

The public kernel snapshot contains the downstream Oculus drivers but not the
private internal driver directory referenced by its top-level Kconfig and
Makefile. Keep the public drivers selectable so the kernel configuration can
be resolved.

---
 drivers/staging/oculus/Kconfig | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/oculus/Kconfig b/drivers/staging/oculus/Kconfig
index e898115d4..e5bb28d70 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/oculus/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/staging/oculus/Kconfig
@@ -241,7 +241,6 @@ config VIRTUAL_SENSOR_UTILS
 	help
 	  This driver implements virtual thermal sensor helper functionality.
 
-source "drivers/staging/oculus/internal/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/staging/oculus/mcu/Kconfig"
 
 endif # OCULUS

